# ── Supabase (waitlist signup only) ────────────────────────────────────────
# The marketing site touches Supabase for exactly one thing: the Android
# waitlist form, which creates a passwordless account and triggers the branded
# "Confirm signup" email.
#
# These are the SAME two values the app uses. The anon/publishable key is meant
# to be in a browser bundle — it is powerless without a Row Level Security
# policy granting something. The service_role key bypasses RLS entirely and
# must NEVER appear in this file or any NEXT_PUBLIC_ variable.
#
# Set both in the Vercel project (Settings → Environment Variables) too, or the
# deployed form falls back to a mailto link.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_publishable_key_here
